Cell["\<\
points contains two-dimensional coordinate lists or label -> coordinates \
rules. Each site phase is tensored with the internal identity matrix.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->563984942,ExpressionUUID->"6d4d0d04-d312-2640-be3f-4346d5b2c75a"],

Cell["\<\
The site phase is Exp[I chi(x,y)], with chi = 2 Pi B (x y Sin[angle]^2 + \
(x^2-y^2) Sin[2 angle]/4).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2019923714,ExpressionUUID->"40840926-bbd7-ae4a-a2d1-cbc878663117"],

Cell["\<\
The result uses site-major ordering, with the internal degrees of freedom \
contiguous at each site.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1187478898,ExpressionUUID->"7412b4a0-83d5-9741-8f5c-6e137e30efeb"]
}, Closed]],

